  lines:
  - '* hey,^05 umm...'
  - '* i think i saw my\n  doppelganger for a\n  split second.'
  - '* i don''t think he\n  saw me,^05 but...'
  - '* i wouldn''t be surprised\n  if he attacked you\n  guys again.'
  - '* so,^05 uhh...'
  - '* i guess i could offer\n  you guys a discount.'
  - '* my treat.'
  - '* I,^05 umm...'
  - '* T-^05thanks!'
  - '* oh,^05 also.'
  - '* maybe go in with an\n  ice weapon on hand.'
  - '* i feel like it''d be\n  important to resolving\n  things well.'
  - '* ...?'
